{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.22, "to": 1.9, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "瞄准就是看得清", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 1.9, "to": 2.54, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "看得懂", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.54, "to": 3.4, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "做得到", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.4, "to": 7.57, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "我在张力控制那期视频讲了关于做得到的部分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.57, "to": 11.03, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "那么本期视频我就以专业的瞄准教练视角", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.03, "to": 12.15, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "来告诉大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.15, "to": 14.17, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛究竟要看哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.17, "to": 17.95, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "我是real一个正在找工作的瞄准教练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.95, "to": 19.71, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "首先我们要明白", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.71, "to": 23.96, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛聚焦在哪里和注意力在哪里是两个概念", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.96, "to": 29.24, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "有的人说看准星是在说眼睛要聚焦到准星附近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.24, "to": 32.93, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "有的人说看目标是在说注意力要放在目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.93, "to": 34.83, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "这实际上是不冲突的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.83, "to": 38.25, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛聚焦在显示器平面上是一个区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.25, "to": 39.37, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "在这个区域内", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.37, "to": 41.63, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "我们可以同时看清准星与目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.63, "to": 43.59, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "以及两者的相对位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.59, "to": 46.68, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "而注意力则只能放在一个东西上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.68, "to": 48.08, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "如果要注意准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.08, "to": 49.94, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "那你就无法注意目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.94, "to": 53.72, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "而注意力不是与眼睛聚焦的区域绑定的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.72, "to": 57.4, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "我们遇到敌人出现在我们准星之外的地方时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.4, "to": 60.14, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "一定是注意力去捕获运动的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.14, "to": 62.73, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "同时移动准星去瞄准目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.73, "to": 64.19, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "在这整个过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.19, "to": 67.27, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "我们的眼睛是一直聚焦在准星附近的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.27, "to": 69.13, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "我们的注意力是注意到了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.13, "to": 71.75, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "出现在余光中的运动目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.69, "to": 77.76, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "或者转火项目得到验证", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.76, "to": 79.62, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "我们在打当下的目标时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.62, "to": 82.84, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "也要时刻注意下一个目标的动态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.84, "to": 86.18, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "而在游戏中摆设或者打跟枪项目的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.18, "to": 89.92, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "我们的注意力就处在眼睛聚焦的区域当中了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.92, "to": 93.06, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "这就是眼睛该看哪里这个问题的答案", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.06, "to": 95.76, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "而看得清不止自己眼睛放在哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.76, "to": 98.25, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "这个内因也还有外因存在", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.25, "to": 100.39, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "那就是显示器的动态清晰度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.39, "to": 101.97, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "是不是听我说到这里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.97, "to": 103.19, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "以为我要接广了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.19, "to": 104.19, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "要开始了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.19, "to": 105.57, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "实际上并没有啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.57, "to": 108.17, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "我有好几个学员都说目标只要动起来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.17, "to": 109.229, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "他就看不清了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 109.229, "to": 111.129, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "而疑问用的什么显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.129, "to": 113.869, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "多数都是比较老的面板或者IPS", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.869, "to": 116.1, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "这种动态清晰度一般的显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.1, "to": 119.54, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "我认为只要经过矫正后的视力没有问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.54, "to": 122.08, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "那么出现看不清运动目标的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.08, "to": 125.1, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "基本上都可以断定是显示器问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.1, "to": 127.3, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "这就是干得清部分的内容了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.3, "to": 128.18, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "那么到这里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.18, "to": 129.42, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "本期视频也就结束了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 129.42, "to": 131.52, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "下一期视频临时插入一条", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.52, "to": 133.78, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "讲什么样是好坐姿的视频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 133.78, "to": 135.829, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "大概在这周末发出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.829, "to": 137.429, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "我目前还在运营", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.429, "to": 138.929, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "无畏契约和瞄准教学", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.929, "to": 140.149, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "如果感兴趣的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.149, "to": 142.029, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "请点个免费的赞和关注吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.029, "to": 143.64, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "我们下期视频再见", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV16ctG6MEgU", "title": "瞄准教练告诉你眼睛到底看哪里", "owner": "sA_Raisuto", "duration": 145}